  "rationale": "An equity track (מניות) fits a horizon of 10 years or more, for someone who accepts a fall of 30% on the way; a general track (כללי) fits 5 years or more and a fall of 20%. The other regulator classifications hold very different mixes under one name (for example index trackers of shares and of bonds), so they show \"no rule\" until the table uses the sub-classification.",
